---
// Ported verbatim from v1's blog-veg-vs-non-veg.html (PRD §8 superseded
// block). Route is the AGENTS.md-bound slug /blog/veg-vs-non-veg/.
//
// v1 bug NOT reproduced (see Phase 3 report — flagged as an owner question):
// this specific post was missing `<script src="script.js">`, so on the live
// site its footer never renders and its .animate-on-scroll hero content
// (badge/heading/subtitle) never becomes visible — IntersectionObserver
// never ran. Reproducing that literally would ship a page that's
// permanently broken by omission, which reads as an accidental content bug
// rather than a design decision, so this page gets the same shared
// Layout/footer/scripts as its four siblings.
import Layout from '../../layouts/Layout.astro';
import BlogPostLayout from '../../components/BlogPostLayout.astro';
import { site } from '../../lib/data';

const title = `Veg vs Non-Veg Pizza in Sundargarh | Best Pizza Choices – ${site.business.name}`;
const description =
  'Confused between veg and non-veg pizza in Sundargarh? Discover what locals love more, top pizza trends, and must-try veg pizzas from The Oven Vibe.';
const pageUrl = new URL(Astro.url.pathname, Astro.site).toString();
const ogImage = new URL('/static/images/blog_images/blog_2.webp', Astro.site).toString();
const waLink = `https://wa.me/${site.business.whatsapp}`;

const jsonLd = {
  '@context': 'https://schema.org',
  '@type': 'BlogPosting',
  headline: 'Veg vs Non-Veg Pizza in Sundargarh | Best Pizza Choices',
  image: ogImage,
  author: { '@type': 'Organization', name: site.business.name },
  publisher: {
    '@type': 'Organization',
    name: site.business.name,
    logo: {
      '@type': 'ImageObject',
      url: new URL('/static/images/brand_images/The%20Oven%20vibe_logo.webp', Astro.site).toString(),
    },
  },
  datePublished: '2024-05-20',
  description: 'Confused between veg and non-veg pizza in Sundargarh? Discover what locals love more.',
};
---

<Layout title={title} description={description}>
  <Fragment slot="head">
    <meta
      name="keywords"
      content="veg pizza in Sundargarh, non veg pizza Sundargarh, best pizza Sundargarh, affordable pizza Sundargarh, The Oven Vibe pizza, paneer pizza Sundargarh"
    />
    <meta property="og:type" content="article" />
    <meta property="og:title" content={title} />
    <meta
      property="og:description"
      content="Confused between veg and non-veg pizza in Sundargarh? Discover what locals love more."
    />
    <meta property="og:url" content={pageUrl} />
    <meta property="og:image" content={ogImage} />
    <meta name="twitter:card" content="summary_large_image" />
    <script type="application/ld+json" is:inline set:html={JSON.stringify(jsonLd)} />
  </Fragment>

  <BlogPostLayout
    line1="VEG VS"
    lineGradient="NON-VEG."
    subtitle="The ultimate pizza debate in Sundargarh. What's your pick?"
  >
    <picture>
      <source type="image/avif" srcset="/static/images/blog_images/blog_2.avif" />
      <source type="image/webp" srcset="/static/images/blog_images/blog_2.webp" />
      <img
        src="/static/images/blog_images/blog_2.webp"
        alt="Veg vs Non-Veg pizza comparison in Sundargarh"
        class="blog-img"
        loading="lazy"
        width="1200"
        height="675"
      />
    </picture>

    <p class="subtitle" style="font-weight: 600; color: #555; margin-top: -10px">
      Local log kya zyada pasand karte hain?
    </p>

    <p>
      Sundargarh mein pizza craze badhta hi ja raha hai! But the biggest debate remains: <strong>Veg Pizza ya Non-Veg Pizza?</strong> While some swear by the juicy chicken toppings,
      others find comfort in cheesy paneer and fresh veggies. Let's dive into what Sundargarh
      locals really love!
    </p>

    <h3>Veg Pizza Lovers in Sundargarh 🥦</h3>
    <p>
      Veg pizzas are surprisingly the top choice for many families and groups in Sundargarh.
      Here's why they are a hit:
    </p>
    <ul>
      <li><strong>Veg Pizza kyun hit hai?</strong> It's lighter, fresh, and full of flavor.</li>
      <li>
        <strong>Budget-friendly options:</strong> Great taste without burning a hole in your
        pocket.
      </li>
      <li>
        <strong>Family & group orders ke liye perfect:</strong> Everyone can share without
        restrictions.
      </li>
      <li><strong>Desi taste with creamy paneer:</strong> The love for paneer is real here!</li>
    </ul>

    <p><strong>Most Loved Veg Pizzas (The Oven Vibe Specials 🍕):</strong></p>
    <ul>
      <li>Paneer Makhni Royale Pizza</li>
      <li>Herb Paneer Delight Pizza</li>
      <li>Mushroom Supreme Pizza</li>
      <li>Vegie Onion Capsicum Pizza</li>
    </ul>

    <h3>Non-Veg Pizza Craze in Sundargarh 🍗</h3>
    <p>
      For the meat lovers, nothing beats a loaded chicken pizza. It's the go-to comfort food for
      many.
    </p>
    <ul>
      <li><strong>Non-Veg kyun pasand aata hai?</strong> The rich, savory taste of chicken.</li>
      <li><strong>Juicy & filling toppings:</strong> Every bite is packed with protein.</li>
      <li>
        <strong>Late-night hunger ke liye best:</strong> Satisfies those midnight cravings
        perfectly.
      </li>
      <li>
        <strong>Friends ke saath sharing ke liye perfect:</strong> A party favorite for sure.
      </li>
    </ul>

    <h3>Veg vs Non-Veg: Local Trend 📊</h3>
    <p>We analyzed the orders and here is what we found:</p>
    <ul>
      <li><strong>Weekdays:</strong> Veg pizzas zyada order hote hain (Light dinners).</li>
      <li><strong>Weekends:</strong> Non-veg pizzas ka demand badhta hai (Party mode on!).</li>
      <li><strong>Families:</strong> Mostly prefer veg pizzas for inclusive dining.</li>
      <li><strong>Friends & late nights:</strong> Mostly non-veg pizzas rule the roost.</li>
    </ul>

    <div class="highlight-box">
      <h3>The Oven Vibe Recommends 🍕🔥</h3>
      <p><strong>Best Veg Picks:</strong></p>
      <ul style="list-style: none; padding-left: 0">
        <li>✔ Paneer Makhni Royale Pizza</li>
        <li>✔ Herb Paneer Delight Pizza</li>
        <li>✔ Mushroom Supreme Pizza</li>
      </ul>
      <p style="margin-top: 10px; font-weight: 700; color: #ad210a">Price for Two: Under ₹350</p>
    </div>

    <h3>Final Slice 😋</h3>
    <p>
      Whether you are team Veg or team Non-Veg, <strong>The Oven Vibe</strong> has something
      special for everyone. Fresh dough, premium toppings, and baked with love right here in
      Sundargarh.
    </p>

    <a href={waLink} target="_blank" class="cta"> 👉 Order now on WhatsApp & enjoy fresh pizzas </a>
  </BlogPostLayout>
</Layout>
